                  Parameters for COKB3D
                  **********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
../data/data.dat                  - file with data
1                                 - number of variables primary+other
1   2   0   3                     - columns for X,Y,Z and variables
-0.01     1.0e21                  - trimming limits
1                                 - co-located cokriging? (0=no, 1=yes)
../data/true.dat                  - file with single gridded covariate
2                                 - column for covariate
0                                 - local varying mean (0=no, 1=yes)
lvmfl.dat                         -  file with local varying mean
1                                 - column for local varying mean
1                                 - debugging level: 0,1,2,3
cokb3d.dbg                        - file for debugging output
cokb3d.out                        - file for output
50   0.5   1.0                    -nx,xmn,xsiz
50   0.5   1.0                    -ny,ymn,ysiz
1    0.5   1.0                    -nz,zmn,zsiz
1    1     1                      -x, y, and z block discretization
1    10    1                        -min primary,max primary,max all sec
20.0  20.0  20.0                  -maximum search radii: primary
10.0  10.0  10.0                  -maximum search radii: all secondary
0.0   0.0   0.0                  -angles for search ellipsoid
1                                -kriging type (0=SK, 1=OK, 2=OK-trad)
3.38  2.32  0.00  0.00            -mean(i),i=1,nvar
2                                -  model type (1=MM1, 2=MM2,3=LMC)
0.493                              - correlation coefficient for MM1 MM2
7.318                              - variance of secondary variable for MM1
25.79                              - variance of primary variable for MM2
2     2                           -semivariogram for "i" and "j"
2    0.3                          -   nst, nugget effect
1    6.9  0.0   0.0   0.0         -   it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         30.0  30.0  30.0         -   a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
3    0.8  0.0   0.0   0.0    -it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
           6.0   6.0  6.0    -a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
1    1
1    0.3
1    0.7  0.0   0.0   0.0         -   it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
         30.0  30.0  30.0         -   a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert


